{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:27 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:27 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:27 2026-10-21 HKT</p><p>今日（21日）下午，警方接獲《香港01》職員報案，指葵涌貨櫃碼頭路88號永得利廣場辦公室收到一封由英國空郵寄港的信件，打開後發現內藏粉末。</p><p>警員接報到場調查，疏散辦公室員工，其後反恐特勤隊、爆炸品處理課（EOD）及消防員亦到場戒備。及後EOD人員檢走一個膠箱，懷疑裝著與案有關物品，正調查有關粉末及事件原因。</p><p>據了解，涉事信件由英國以空郵寄出，信封寫有「《01線報》收」，郵戳顯示於10月13日經英國郵政處理。</p><img alt=\"爆炸品處理課檢走一個膠箱，懷疑裝著與案有關物品。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/348138d8403b62f8a05f1d6b43439d3e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_16_58_21.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"《香港01》職員今日打開一封由英國空郵寄港的信件，發現內藏白色粉末。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b033abb02390a3c14f71cafa853172e7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_15_49_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37215909d9204e8cd6f33fdf4e39f3f8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_16_05_26_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批警員到場戒備。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39ab49113b58abfa0d16d3fadc3edef7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_16_05_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da94e9cb075f2d33dbfb4384c0e5e235/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_16_05_27.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:21:23.952183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":288,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:27:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:18:08.031178+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:17:58.707181+00:00","content_hash":"2bb6874712e485f9c993a59f5e79cde49b1fc91d72130bd6b69aa447604d8dae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}